Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.03,0:00:05.99,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Lady Lily wrote her message on a scrap\N torn from a sightseeing brochure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:11.25,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,The "P10" engraved on the key\N indicates page 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.23,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Then we find "E" on the map,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:14.44,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,and "3" is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:17.22,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Here! Saint Mark's Square!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:19.49,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:22.99,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,We're probably looking for somewhere\Nthe Orlamundes make donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:25.40,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,So, the Museum of History.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.34,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Which brings us to this holy scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:32.01,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,But surely it's of great historical value?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:36.16,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,That would be the point. \NDidn't I tell you she wasn't normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.51,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.23,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:17.95,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,I've always hated to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:22.68,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,I never doubted that \Nthe goddesses had chosen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.00,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,That I was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.25,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,THE RECOLLECTIONS OF LILY ORLAMUNDE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.29,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,Not until that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:35.54,Flashback,Lily's Father,0,0,0,,Look, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:36.51,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,21 YEARS AGO\NLILY, AGE 5
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.80,Flashback,Lily's Father,0,0,0,,That's young Lady Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:47.51,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,For the first time in my life,\N I felt defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:53.53,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you. \NMy name is Lily Orlamunde.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.48,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,My, what a dreadful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:59.70,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,S-Surely such rudeness is uncalled for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:03.18,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,And etiquette demands you \Ngive me your name as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.86,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,It's Scarlett Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:12.74,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,But you gave offense to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:18.10,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,You harbor ill will toward me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:23.37,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Such bearing marks you out\N as a fourth-rate lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.30,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,Fourth-rate...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.95,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,One of my mother's pet phrases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.95,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,That was how Scarlett and I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.00,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,Several years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.31,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,18 YEARS AGO\NLILY, AGE 8
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:41.80,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,we were chosen to be the crown prince's \Nplaymates during his convalescence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.11,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,We went to spend time together\N at the royal family's summer retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.52,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Can't you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.89,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,Wh-What insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:56.57,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,D-Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.87,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,My, what a fool you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:02.79,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,How would I know anyone who hasn't \Nproperly introduced themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.33,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,S-Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:06.45,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,I'm Enrique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:14.11,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Come with me. I'll show you \Na sight worth seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.56,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,It's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:26.64,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:29.91,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,It's a waste to spend \Nall your time indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:33.45,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Just look at what a wide world \Nthere is to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:45.48,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Oh dear. Running late, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:52.32,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,I need to submit this before \Nmy tutor gets back to his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.72,Flashback - Italics,Young Lily {M},0,0,0,,He's crying again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:05:00.06,Flashback,Young Lily,0,0,0,,In that case, allow me to gain you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:05.36,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,I won't help you. It's too tiresome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.30,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,Lily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:13.45,Flashback,Servant A,0,0,0,,Lady Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:14.86,Flashback,Servant B,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:19.50,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there. \NWe're going to turn in your assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.58,Flashback,Young Enrique,0,0,0,,B-But what about Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.58,0:05:24.30,Flashback,Young Scarlett,0,0,0,,Lily's telling you to get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:39.74,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,Around that time, His Royal Highness \Nstarted to laugh more and more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.23,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,14 YEARS AGO\NLILY, AGE 12
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:52.11,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,Soon, the two of them were engaged, \Nand I assumed they'd be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:59.44,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,But with the arrival of Cecilia Luze, \Ndestiny started to go awry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.41,0:06:02.88,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,What does Your Royal Highness mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:02.88,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,10 YEARS AGO\NSCARLETT IMPRISONED
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.84,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Scarlett, a poisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.26,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Surely she would never do\N anything so underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:12.75,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,A moonbowstone earring \Nwas found at the Luze residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:16.77,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,I'm certain it's one of a pair\N I gave to Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.76,0:06:18.76,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.26,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,I don't wish to see her put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:26.28,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,How could I ever want that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.63,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:32.54,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,It's hopeless. The king has decided it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.95,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,His Royal Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.35,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:42.47,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Why would the king involve himself in the \Nattempted murder of a viscount's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:49.43,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,And what is Duke Castiel doing? \NHis daughter is bound for the headsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:51.44,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Is he powerless to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.18,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Or does he choose not to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:57.34,Flashback,Scarlett,0,0,0,,A public execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.23,Flashback,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'd like nothing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:05.39,Flashback,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'll show them all that I shall \Nbe the one with the last laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:17.97,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,You never know how fate will play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:26.24,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,Before I knew it, eight years had \Ngone by since Scarlett's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:26.75,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,2 YEARS AGO\NLILY, AGE 24
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:32.76,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,At the time, I'd come to devote \Nmyself to aiding the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:38.76,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,One day, while I was looking \Nfor a good place to establish a school...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:46.53,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Cecilia? What is she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:51.52,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Kiriki kirikuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.76,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,It really is her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:04.82,Flashback,Krishna,0,0,0,,Good news. The Holy Grail of Eris \Nis finally about to resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:08.30,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Took you long enough. Do you know \Nhow many years I've waited?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:12.87,Flashback,Salvador,0,0,0,,Well, we can't afford another failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:14.80,Flashback,Salvador,0,0,0,,And neither can Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:18.30,Flashback,Krishna,0,0,0,,So, how's progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:23.57,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,I already have Viscount Luze \Nhooked on Jackal's Paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:27.69,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,and I'm having explosives \Nsmuggled in from Melvina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.55,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,I can start a revolt at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:33.60,Flashback,Krishna,0,0,0,,How splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.67,0:08:38.23,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,What were they talking about? \NExplosives? Revolt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:42.83,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Don't tell me \N"The Holy Grail of Eris" is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:45.48,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,a Farisian invasion plot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:52.96,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,From that day on, I began gathering \Ninformation in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:09:01.20,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,My contract marriage to Randolph, on the \Ncondition of mutual noninterference,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:04.99,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,made it easier for me to move freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:09.32,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,I lose! You're good at this, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.94,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,So, you wanna know about Paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:16.33,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,The Roosters bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.23,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,"Roosters"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:21.99,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,An outfit called Daeg Gallus, \N"the cock that crows at dawn."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.23,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Daeg Gallus...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.26,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,Anyway, watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:29.75,Flashback,Informant,0,0,0,,Once they set their sights on you,\N you're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:49.01,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,I was boxed in on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:52.95,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,They had infiltrated everywhere \NI could think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:55.41,Main - Italics,Lily {N},0,0,0,,There was nothing \Nthe likes of me could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.25,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,Lady Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:04.82,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,If it does come to war, the first victims
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:07.26,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,will be these orphaned children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:15.09,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,Lady Lily, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:20.09,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,"Kiriki kirikuku"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:24.48,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,If anything should happen to me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:29.61,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,and people come asking \Nabout me, recite this spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:34.60,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,If they react to it at all, \Nyou'll know they're very bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:38.39,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,If that happens, I want you \Nto gather everyone and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:40.77,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,You can do that, can't you, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:43.96,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:48.27,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,I want you to come with us when we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.22,Flashback,Orphans,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.80,Flashback - Top,Orphans,0,0,0,,Lady Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.12,Flashback,Orphans,0,0,0,,Lady Lily, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:57.07,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to stop \Nbad things from happening to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:58.12,Flashback,Tony,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.97,0:11:02.50,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Oh, what am I to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:07.01,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,How can I safeguard \Nthese children's futures?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.65,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.58,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I'm going to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.66,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,one last wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:23.65,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Royal Highness, it's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.65,0:11:28.16,Flashback,Enrique,0,0,0,,I heard you're here to see Cecilia. \NIs there some kind of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.82,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you concerned for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:33.66,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm only going to visit your own consort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:40.87,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,The crown prince didn't \Nmarry Cecilia out of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:43.92,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,He must have had some goal in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:47.56,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I'm certain he's picked up \Non things himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:49.98,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,But nothing has changed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:57.95,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Honestly, what have you been doing for \Neight whole years, you fourth-rate prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:02.41,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,You haven't given up yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:08.29,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I see he's still a crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:13.04,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,In that case, allow me to gain you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:17.99,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,That's just like you, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:19.82,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,What a marvelous idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:23.46,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for saying so,\N Your Royal Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:29.26,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,I thought I'd start by repairing \Nthe church on Leda Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:30.10,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:34.76,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, I happened to see \NYour Royal Highness the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.09,0:12:38.48,Flashback,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Goodness. Do you really \Nthink I'd go {\i1}there{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:41.48,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,I don't believe I said where.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:49.49,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, do the words "the Holy Grail \Nof Eris" mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.49,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,In the event they happen to,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:56.76,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,I suggest you rethink your plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:13:00.25,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,You can't afford another \Nfailure, now can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.49,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:10.54,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I'm merely a sheltered young noblewoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:13.75,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I can't stop their plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:18.31,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,But if they think I'll accept defeat, \Nthey have another think coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:22.58,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Cecilia and her coconspirators \Nsaid they can't afford to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:25.85,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,So I'll make use of that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:30.25,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I'll make them think their secret \Nis out and delay their plots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:36.29,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I gave them a glimpse of my fake key \Nin order to mislead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:40.79,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,If I manage to get away, \Ntheir misconception will become truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:46.22,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,The real truth, as far as I know it, \Nis in the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:52.37,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,"Destroy the Holy Grail of Eris."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:55.55,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I couldn't manage it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:58.38,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,but I'll let someone else \Ntake it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:02.04,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Someone alive in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:08.86,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,How haughty and proud they'll have to be \Nto dare look down on the gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:14.23,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,and how unbelievably softhearted \Nto risk everything for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:18.36,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,It will take a miracle for \Nsomeone like that to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:24.86,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,But what's wrong with \Nbelieving in miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.48,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,They haven't come. I won my wager.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:33.84,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Till the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:40.02,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,I didn't understand how Scarlett \Ncould smile like that back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:44.97,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,But now I'm glad that she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.13,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:51.12,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,If Scarlett can do it, \Nthen, naturally, so can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:52.87,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:04.56,Flashback - Italics,Lily {M},0,0,0,,Lily Orlamunde has always hated to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.96,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Then this means the Holy Grail of Eris
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:16.72,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,is a Farisian military operation... \Nto invade Adelbide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:23.54,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,"In closing, to whoever finds this letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:25.23,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I place the future in your hands."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:32.46,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,She's placed the future in our hands, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:35.82,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I wonder what we can actually do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.37,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Hey, got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.28,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,A-Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.60,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Shh! Not so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:49.89,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm dead meat if {\i1}she{\i0} finds out \NI'm still in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:51.18,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,She who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:52.43,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:57.58,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,This is everything I dug up \Non Crown Princess Cecilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:00.69,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Make good use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:03.62,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,And there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:08.69,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,At a glance, Cecilia's mother \Nwas a prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:14.06,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Kevin Jennings found out \Nand developed a crippling drug addiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:21.50,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,and was placed in Saint Nicholas Hospital,\N run by Cecilia's charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:25.45,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What would Crown Princess Cecilia \Nwant with a hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:31.01,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,This is only a guess, but perhaps \Nshe was testing Jackal's Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:32.97,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,In the name of "treatment."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:38.35,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Earl Campbell used \Nto oversee that hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:44.85,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,and he's linked to Cecilia by \NSimon Darkian, Deborah's husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:46.76,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her{\i0} husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:54.23,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Enrique, Cecilia, the Darkians,\N Daeg Gallus, those sly Farisian dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:59.21,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,It's gotten so convoluted I don't know \Nwho to exact my revenge on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:02.14,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Won't {\i1}someone{\i0} think of me for a change?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:09.14,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,If this is how it is, I'll thrash everyone\Nwho had anything to do with my execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:12.03,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:17.01,Main - Italics,Connie {M},0,0,0,,How does she expect to "thrash" \Nall those eminent personages?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:22.65,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Reports on a ten-year-old investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:27.78,Main - Top,Dylan,0,0,0,,You're after the truth behind \NScarlett Castiel's execution, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:33.78,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I hear your fiancée \Nhas been poking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.40,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Come now. Don't you scowl at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:43.79,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I am your superior officer, remember? \NAnd commandant, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.41,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I'm a real important fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:48.22,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Say something already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:52.98,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Well, I can see why you'd be curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:54.67,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:57.99,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Weren't you accused of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:18:02.49,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,and nearly executed yourself \Naround that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.43,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,It's Faris we ought to worry about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:10.54,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Have you learned anything \Nabout the missing seventh prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:17.51,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,No, although I tried to probe the head \Nof their delegation, Kendall Levine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:21.02,Flashback,Kendall,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.83,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,He seems disinclined \Nto make the matter public.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.10,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:32.56,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Their king is bedridden due to illness, \Nand I hear rumors of a succession dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:34.16,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.61,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Faris is reminting coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:41.44,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Gunpowder, iron, and wagon production \Nare growing rapidly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:45.55,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,It sounds like they're preparing for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:51.31,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Right. And if so, it'll be war \Nwith us here in Adelbide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:54.33,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Do they have a casus belli?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:58.54,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,Proper justification?\N They could easily trump something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:02.57,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,They've always had a knack \Nfor that kind of maneuvering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:06.09,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,But we won't give them the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:11.08,Default,Dylan,0,0,0,,That is the duty of those \Nwhose lives were spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:19.42,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I looked over all \Nthe investigation reports, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:20.34,Default,San,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.34,0:19:23.35,Default,San,0,0,0,,Fancy meeting you again, Holy Grail Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:25.59,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.59,0:19:28.28,Default,Eularia,0,0,0,,Miss Grail, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:34.35,Default,Eularia,0,0,0,,Pardon her. "Grail" is synonymous \Nwith "holy grail" in Old Farish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:36.22,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You come from Faris, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:40.22,Default,San,0,0,0,,And you must be Earl Randolph Ulster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:42.74,Default,San,0,0,0,,We're here today to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:45.00,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:48.40,Default,San,0,0,0,,I hear you were most attentive \Nto our dear Kendall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:56.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,His Royal Highness Ulysses, Seventh Prince\N of Faris, was abducted in Adelbide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:20:03.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,Faris will use retribution to justify \Ndeclaring war on your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:04.99,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,But that's—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,All staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:11.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,Daeg Gallus did the abducting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:14.02,Default,San,0,0,0,,They're pulling the strings\N from backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:17.01,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:21.85,Default,San,0,0,0,,We come from Faris, sure enough. Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:25.78,Default,Eularia,0,0,0,,Her Royal Highness Alexandria,\N Third Princess of Faris, sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:27.79,Default,Eularia,0,0,0,,We don't want war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.76,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,You don't...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:35.57,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please, will you work with us\N to stop this war?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:40.92,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,It's all as Lily wrote in her letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:45.44,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,So, um, why did the plan ten years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:48.44,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Why did the Holy Grail of Eris fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:50.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,You mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:54.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,It failed because Scarlett Castiel \Nwas executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:00.18,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,So that's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:04.70,Main - Top,Adolphus,0,0,0,,Have you finished building your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:09.89,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:15.21,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Scarlett's mother was \NAliénore Shibola, was she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:20.80,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,She was a lineal descendant of \NCornelia of the Starry Crown,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:23.49,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,the last ruler of the vast empire \Nthat Faris once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:27.88,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,The royal family of Adelbide \Npossesses reddish-violet eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:31.71,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,while Farisian royals \Nhave bluish-violet eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:39.20,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,And amethyst eyes, blending red and blue, \Nhave a special significance in Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:43.72,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,The true goal of \Nthe Holy Grail of Eris was most likely
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:46.86,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,to install a descendant \Nof the old imperial family,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:50.62,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Scarlett Castiel, on Adelbide's throne
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:54.40,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,and transform us \Ninto a vassal state of Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:01.49,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,But Scarlett was executed\N a decade ago, foiling the plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:07.22,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Her death saved Adelbide \Nfrom being murdered in its sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.15,0:22:09.02,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,But perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:13.06,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,someone ensured events \Nwould play out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.11,0:22:27.45,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,In other words, my execution \Nwas my father's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.31,0:22:35.69,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Adelbide avoided its fate with Faris \Nthanks to my timely death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.69,0:22:40.54,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,My father would think nothing of \Nsacrificing his daughter for his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:42.52,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Duke Castiel did that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.79,0:22:48.06,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,How could anyone... be so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:53.81,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Let's go, Scarlett!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:59.30,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Let's go see Duke Castiel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.12,0:23:03.25,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,He isn't the kind of man \Nyou can simply go visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:05.81,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,If today doesn't work, \Nthere's always tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.51,0:23:08.90,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,He's bound to see us eventually \Nif we only keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:12.88,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,So I'm going to call on the duke today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:16.27,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.95,0:23:19.77,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I'll arrange a meeting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:27.35,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,We appreciate Your Grace's generosity \Nin granting us this audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:31.08,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,May I introduce my fiancée, \NConstance Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:33.60,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I-It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:40.10,Default,Adolphus,0,0,0,,Now then, my sincere young lady, \Nwhat would you like to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:48.39,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Was it Your Grace who sent \NScarlett to the scaffold?
